<title>NETHERLANDS: ATAG DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>ATAG DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>ULFT, Netherlands 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial group Atag Holding NV said on Wednesday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 44 held.</p>
<p>On February 21, the company announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 2.30 guilders, down from 4.09 in 1995, or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Atag's shares traded at 104.00 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Wednesday, down 3.60 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
